hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"269","On the authority of Abdullah bin Saeed Al-Ashjaj, on the authority of Abu Yahya, meaning Al-Taymi, on the authority of Al-Amash, on the authority of Salama bin Kuhail, on the authority of Saeed bin Abdul Rahman, On the authority of his father, he said: A man came to Omar and said: We are in the state of ritual impurity, and we have no water. So he mentioned his story with Ammar bin Yasser, and he said: He meant Ammar: So I went to the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, and told him, and he said: “It was enough for you to say thus and that with your hands,” and he struck. with his hands to the dirt, then shook them, then blew on them and wiped his face and hands with them.” Abu Bakr said: Shu’bah included a bit of disagreement between Salama bin Kuhail and Sa’id bin Abdul Rahman in this news. It was narrated by Al-Thawri, on the authority of Salamah, on the authority of Abu Malik, and Abdullah bin Abdul-Rahman bin Abza, on the authority of Abd al-Rahman bin Abza, except that It is not in the news of Al-Thawri, and Shu’bah: shaking the hands from the dust."
"270","Yusuf bin Musa told us, Abu Muawiyah told us, Al-Amash told us, on the authority of Shaqiq, who said: I was sitting with Abdullah and Abu Musa, and Abu Musa said: Oh Abu Abdul Rahman, have you seen that if a man is in a state of impurity and does not find water for a month, he should perform tayammum? Abdullah said: He is not an orphan. Abu Musa said: Did you not hear Ammar say to Omar: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, sent me for a need? So I became junub and could not find water, so I wallowed in the desert as an animal wallows. I mentioned that to the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, and the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: May God bless him and grant him peace: “It was enough for you to strike your palms on the ground, then wipe them, then wipe your face and your palms with them.” Abu Bakr said: His statement in this report: Then he wiped them is to shake it with his eyes, which is to wipe one palm with the other to shake it off. There is no dirt on them"
